# stemLM needs no environment variables to build, test or run locally.
#
# `.env` is gitignored: keep local-only values there and never commit it.
# Everything compiled into the extension is readable by anyone who installs it,
# so a secret must never reach an extension build. A PostHog project API key is
# designed to be public; a PostHog personal API key is a secret and must never
# appear here or in the bundle.
